@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
left to right direction
rectangle "requested\n(제어식)" as req
rectangle "safe\n(중재와 제약\n적용 후)" as safe
rectangle "논리 결과의\n원자적 확정\n(런타임)" as commit
rectangle "applied\n(renderer가\n버스 명령 전송)" as applied
rectangle "confirmed\n(피드백 증거:\n접점·기계가 움직임)" as conf
req --> safe
safe --> commit
commit --> applied
applied --> conf
note bottom of conf
  서로 다른 세 가지 사실:
  확정 != applied != confirmed
end note
@enduml
